WEBVTT

00:11:28.079 --> 00:11:32.936
that when we actually don't care
about these difficult things,

00:11:34.103 --> 00:11:37.513
the positive and wonderful things
are nonetheless implicated.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:40.647
We love innovation.

00:11:40.671 --> 00:11:43.286
We love technology. We love creativity.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.286
We love entertainment.

00:11:46.436 --> 00:11:47.726
But ultimately,

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:52.539
those realities are shadowed by suffering,

00:11:52.563 --> 00:11:55.408
abuse, degradation,

00:11:55.432 --> 00:11:56.726
marginalization.

00:11:57.365 --> 00:12:01.164
And for me, it becomes necessary
to integrate the two,